<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
Demo partners with invented names, example.com-style addresses and fictional phone numbers.
     A company is a root partner with a tax ID (is_company is computed from it); its people
     are child contacts. Mitra Kayu, Baja Sentosa, Kopi Gunung and Cipta Digital are vendors the product demo prices
     (product.supplierinfo); Toko Maju and Griya Persada are customers. No demo users are created: a demo user would need a password, and demo
     data never ships credentials. 
-->
